   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The nurse is working with a group of older adult couples to help them learn more about fall prevention and how to make modifications in their home to decrease their risk of falls. This is an example of which level of health promotion?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1275996,
     "content_html": "Primary",
     "correctness": "1.0"
    },
    {
     "id": 1275995,
     "content_html": "Secondary",
     "correctness": "0.0"
    },
    {
